course: dictionary
lesson: 15225
title: The seventeenth
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Words like first, second, third and seventeenth tell you the position of something in a line or list. «Maya finished the race in seventeenth place.» That means she was the 17th runner to finish.
explain: Seventeenth is an ordinal number, and it is written short as 17th. «It was her seventeenth birthday, so she was turning 17.» Count to check: first, second, third, and so on, up to seventeenth.
explain: Seventeenth can also be a fraction. One seventeenth means one of 17 equal parts of a whole, and it is written 1/17. «Each slice was one seventeenth of the cake.» Five seventeenths is written 5/17.
fact: Seventeenth is an ordinal number: it tells the position in an order, like the seventeenth runner.
fact: Written short, seventeenth is 17th.
fact: As a fraction, one seventeenth is 1/17, and five seventeenths is 5/17.
fact: «The seventeenth floor» is the floor that comes right after the sixteenth floor.
exercise: «Maya came seventeenth in the race.» What place did Maya finish in? | Seventy | Seventh | *Seventeenth | Fifteenth
exercise: Written short, seventeenth is which number? | *17th | 7th | 71st | 1st
exercise: «Each of the 17 equal parts was one seventeenth of the pizza.» How do you write one seventeenth as a fraction? | 17/1 | 1/7 | *1/17 | 7/17
test: «Tom lives on the seventeenth floor.» What does seventeenth mean here? | Number 1 in the order | *Number 17 in the order | Number 70 in the order | Number 7 in the order
test: How do you write five seventeenths as a fraction? | 1/5 | 5/7 | 17/5 | *5/17
exam: Which word means number 17 in an order or list? | Seventeen | Seventy | *Seventeenth | Seventh
